[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5105.91, "timestamp": "01:25:05", "text": "也。就是这样。而且我吃得也不像我平时那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5108.39, "timestamp": "01:25:08", "text": "不像个吃零食的运动员那样吃东西。我在吃东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5113.669, "timestamp": "01:25:13", "text": "就像一顿完整的正餐。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5116.55, "timestamp": "01:25:16", "text": "而且我当时还特别瘦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5118.79, "timestamp": "01:25:18", "text": "伙计，我本来想说我们可能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5121.75, "timestamp": "01:25:21", "text": "差不多，因为我也没有长胖。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5125.35, "timestamp": "01:25:25", "text": "全部。我以前体重只有38磅左右。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5128.95, "timestamp": "01:25:28", "text": "公斤之类的东西，或者更少。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5132.95, "timestamp": "01:25:32", "text": "现在大概是46左右吧。 45 I"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5134.709, "timestamp": "01:25:34", "text": "思考。我不知道。体重仍然偏轻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5136.87, "timestamp": "01:25:36", "text": "尽管。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5139.07, "timestamp": "01:25:39", "text": "我曾经在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5143.83, "timestamp": "01:25:43", "text": "50，那也太少了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5146.87, "timestamp": "01:25:46", "text": "我的身高。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5148.709, "timestamp": "01:25:48", "text": "那对我来说基本上不算什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5149.88, "timestamp": "01:25:49", "text": "高度。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5151.27, "timestamp": "01:25:51", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5152.87, "timestamp": "01:25:52", "text": "当我告诉别人我的体重时，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5155.95, "timestamp": "01:25:55", "text": "比如，“不，那不可能是……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5158.47, "timestamp": "01:25:58", "text": "对。”他们会说，“就是那样。”"}]